      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-idle</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-idle for compilation:</para>

      <para>Now Configure the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">cargo fetch --locked
</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --release --frozen
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-idle /usr/bin/cosmic-idle
</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

